# Sv32 malformed non-leaf PTE regression.
# Host setup preloads:
# - satp = active Sv32 root
# - mstatus = MPRV with MPP=Supervisor
# - the root PTE for virtual address 0x8000 is a non-leaf pointer with reserved A-bit set
